@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Communication wait-for deadlock candidate

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #343A40
  FontColor #212529
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "Ordered ChannelEvent sequences\nper top-level process" as EVENTS #DBE4FF
component "First relevant operation\nSend · SendSync · linear Recv" as FIRST #FFF3BF
component "Resolved initial waits\nprocess waits on channel" as WAITS #FFE8CC
component "Producer sets\nprocesses sending per channel" as SENDERS #C3FAE8
component "Conservative edge gate\nknown producer set is non-empty and\nevery producer is initially blocked" as GATE #E5DBFF
component "Wait-for projection\nP -> Q with site/range evidence" as GRAPH #D3F9D8
component "Shared projection_sccs\ncyclic components incl. self-loop" as SCC #FCC2D7
component "CommunicationCycle\nprocesses · channels · witnesses" as REPORT #FFE3E3
component "No edge\nunresolved or ready producer" as SUPPRESS #F1F3F5

EVENTS --> FIRST
FIRST --> WAITS : first is Recv(c)
FIRST --> SUPPRESS : first is send / unresolved
EVENTS --> SENDERS
WAITS --> GATE
SENDERS --> GATE
GATE --> GRAPH : predicate true
GATE --> SUPPRESS : predicate false
GRAPH --> SCC
SCC --> REPORT : cyclic SCC

note bottom of REPORT
  Structural and advisory: the SCC is not a runtime reachability proof.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| ordered typed evidence |
|<#FFF3BF>| initial-operation classification |
|<#FFE8CC>| blocked process evidence |
|<#C3FAE8>| producer evidence |
|<#E5DBFF>| false-positive reduction gate |
|<#D3F9D8>| canonical wait-for projection |
|<#FCC2D7>| reused SCC engine |
|<#FFE3E3>| advisory cyclic finding |
|<#F1F3F5>| explicit suppression/uncertainty |
endlegend
@enduml
